                    <p><strong>Pinnacle Drops</strong> are alerts that indicate a significant drop in Pinnacle's odds. They can provide an additional view of market movement, especially when compared with the current prices on the Betfair Exchange.</p>
                    <p>In some situations, Pinnacle may move its odds before a corresponding movement appears on Betfair. This time difference can give traders additional real-time market information to consider.</p>
                    <p>BF Markets displays Pinnacle Drop alerts alongside relevant Betfair market data, allowing you to see the Pinnacle movement and compare it with the current Betfair market.</p>
                    <div class="highlight-box">
